dback you can drop in our Steam Subforums OR...Don't forget to:Join the official Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:00:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032786","verified_at":"2026-10-22T14:19:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1846651706690521","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"Next_Fest.exe","summary":"This is just a reminder that I have an extremely boring demo you should play. Steam Next Fest is running from 19th to 26th October.There have been some fixes and quality of life updates for you all too:Added rear and front sight highlighting options - including \"off\" setting (note that this will also disable the peep sight blur effect on rear sight).Added mouse sensitivity settings, with separate settings for weapon manipulation, aim and bunker.Added an alternative binding to Middle Mouse Button","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:30:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690521","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1846018067931129","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"BROADCAST","summary":"Hey folks! There is now a stream on the store page, in which you can watch me play some of my own game. Enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T19:00:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931129","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1846018067931067","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO","summary":"A demo?! That’s RIGHT! You thought we were going to make you wait forever… but it’s ready, right here!Choose your loadout! Start off with a trusty Air Pistol and gather enough tokens to unlock the Volcanic and Sten gun… whichever you pick, make sure you’re checking all the necessary equipment around you to make your shooting oh-so-much more accurate and reproducible! That’s not all, with 90+ interchangeable parts to obtain and a handful of cartridges to play with, you’ll be busy finding your fav","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T18:40:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067931067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1845383656396742","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"Convergence.exe","summary":"You might want to watch Convergence Showcase with us because Ballistic.exe will be featured!When: 8th October 17:30 UTCWhere: Convergence Games Showcase on YouTube, Twitch & Steam Be there or be square! And don't forget to...Join the official Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T15:00:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396742","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1845383656377938","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"dev_log.txt v2.0","summary":"05/09/2630+ fixes and regression fixesSubstantial tutorial update, now presenting the global game loop more thoroughlyFix colt navy attach type for stocksPlayer can now purchase guides for each weapon from workshop tabs.Fix text alignment for objectives pips without iconsAdd tooltips to objective pipsDisplay energy needed to break object through spotter camPitch and yaw input are now non-inverted by defaultAdd option to invert pitch and yaw input in game settingsFix line height misalignment when","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T15:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377938","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1844115010489382","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"dev_log.txt v1.0","summary":"07/05/26This week I was mainly focused on building/improving the first map, by adding and setting up targets and special events:Improved the \"secret events\" system that can trigger many things in a level by shooting secret targets or meeting some conditionsNew screen that lists the uncovered secrets and clues as to what you can make happen in each levelTargets with an active bonus are now highlighted in red14/05/26I'd like to point out of the record - Most of these dev logs from here on out are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T15:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010489382","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1843481262688826","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"Kwalee Enters the Chat","summary":"It’s been a little while since you last heard from me here. I only just got out.That’s right: Ballistic.exe has a publisher! Welcome Kwalee, who’ll be helping me with QA, marketing, and all the other things needed to bring a successful game to the world in 202X. Development is going full steam ahead with many exciting things to show you soon.You’ll see some new names and faces on Discord and social media, but I’ll still be posting and hanging out in the community for my allotted daily recreation","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T12:00:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262688826","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1830797770230270","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"The big jump","summary":"Well, this is it: As of last monday, I quit my job and I am now working on Ballistic.exe full time!It feels great to switch from daily to hourly commits, and spend time with my daughter on evenings instead of working all night.Still, it is as scary as it is exciting! But we are now nearing 30k wishlists, and this move doesn't feel as incredibly foolish as it did only a year ago.Still, I thank you every time you share the game or help grow the community in any way, we wouldn't be here without you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-22T10:23:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770230270","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:08:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3432980-1819386365090800","game_id":"steam-3432980","kind":"announcement","title":"Wrapping up 2025","summary":"As 2025 comes to a close, I wanted to updated you on the developpement that occured these passed few months, from October until today.For a summary of the work that was done earlier in the year, please refer to the 9 months in development article !As you can see, gameplay and content were the main focus of these past months. Content will be even more important next year, since gameplay is getting quite close to complete.You can find all these updates weekly on the game's Discord sever if you pre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-18T17:43:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://